abstract: |-
  The Grab's Trademarks Logo. They did not publish any trademark guideline but
  did supply the material files for it. The preferred version is `.svg` which
  has non-destructive scale up & down properties and can be converted into any
  rasterized images (e.g. `jpeg`, `webp`, `avif`, etc). To comply with our
  standards, a re-draw is required.

  This project re-draws Grab's Trademarks Logo specifically for 1200x1200 size.
